      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Gambá. Stunky libera pela traseira um líquido de cheiro horrível, que pode ser sentido a mais de 1,6 quilômetro de distância. O odor causa náusea e permanece perceptível por até 2 quilômetros.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Stunky pode evoluir para Skuntank no nível 12 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Focus Energy, Poison Gas, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Fury Swipes, Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Feint, Smokescreen</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Acid Spray, Bite, Venoshock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Slash, Toxic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Memento, Night Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Sucker Punch, Venom Drench</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Belch, Explosion</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Assurance, Attract, Body Slam, Confide, Corrosive Gas, Crunch, Dark Pulse, Defog, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Endure, Explosion, Facade, Fire Blast, Flamethrower, Focus Energy, Foul Play, Frustration, Gunk Shot, Haze, Helping Hand, Hex, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Lash Out, Nasty Plot, Payback, Play Rough, Poison Jab, Poison Tail, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Smash, Round, Scary Face, Screech, Shadow Ball, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Sludge Wave, Snarl, Snatch, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tail Slap, Take Down, Taunt, Temper Flare, Tera Blast, Thief, Throat Chop, Torment, Toxic, Toxic Spikes, Trailblaze, Venoshock</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Astonish, Crunch, Double-Edge, Flame Burst, Foul Play, H az e, Iron Tail, Leer, Play Rough, Punishment, Pursuit, Scary Face, Slash, Sm o g</p>",
